        Develop confidence, composure under pressure and the discipline needed
        to be a champ. This is the club you’ve been looking for.
      </p>
      <div class="cs-button-group">
        <a href="" class="cs-button-solid cs-button1">Read More</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="cs-card-group">
      <li class="cs-item">
        <picture class="cs-picture">
          <!--Mobile Image-->
