          </p>
          <a href="/" class="cs-link">
            Join Us Today
            <img
              class="cs-arrow"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              src="https://csimg.nyc3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/Images/Icons/chevron-right-red.svg"
